  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senior secondment - will be responsible for Climate change and environmental initiative. Will also help to facilitate UNDP policy engagement, programming, communication and project implementation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Senior sekondering som milj&#xf6; och klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringssepcialist. Ansvarig f&#xf6;r UNDP Kambodja att arbeta inom omr&#xe5;det. Hj&#xe4;lpa till med att facilitera UNDPs policy engagemnang, programmering, kommunikation och projekt implementering inom omr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
  </description>
